; ============================================================================
; DNS zone file for hanhduywedding.online  →  GitHub Pages (user anhduy0911)
; Import this at your DNS provider (vCloudDNS: "Import zone" / BIND format).
; Names are written fully-qualified (with trailing dot) for max compatibility,
; since some panels don't accept the "@" shorthand for the root domain.
; Most providers manage SOA + NS automatically, so only the records below matter.
; ============================================================================

$TTL 3600

; --- Root / apex → GitHub Pages IPv4 (REQUIRED) ----------------------------
hanhduywedding.online.      IN  A       185.199.108.153
hanhduywedding.online.      IN  A       185.199.109.153
hanhduywedding.online.      IN  A       185.199.110.153
hanhduywedding.online.      IN  A       185.199.111.153

; --- Root / apex → GitHub Pages IPv6 (optional) ----------------------------
hanhduywedding.online.      IN  AAAA    2606:50c0:8000::153
hanhduywedding.online.      IN  AAAA    2606:50c0:8001::153
hanhduywedding.online.      IN  AAAA    2606:50c0:8002::153
hanhduywedding.online.      IN  AAAA    2606:50c0:8003::153

; --- www subdomain → your GitHub Pages site --------------------------------
www.hanhduywedding.online.  IN  CNAME   anhduy0911.github.io.
